{"version":1,"content":"<p>法庭文件顯示，美國初創企業GG Technologies在印度起訴蘋果，指控蘋果的NameDrop功能（將兩台設備靠近即可分享聯繫人信息）侵犯其專利技術。GG Technologies開發了StayTouch應用，該應用支持手機貼近交換聯繫方式，公司索賠150億盧比（約1.6186億美元），並申請禁令。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587370.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.705766+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:09:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_hash":"188254521897652d7b93ce43866ef8dfa7df9135c55038c61e1db24e3ba41202","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}